WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Open a three-page PDF and find the signature box on page 3.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Prepare your signature and add it once to the selected page.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Move the mark into the box without covering the document text.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Download the visual copy and check all three pages before sending it.
